All the proceeds I receive from
the sales of my books go to charity.

00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:06.560
NutritionFacts.org is a nonprofit,
science-based public service,

00:15:06.560 --> 00:15:08.400
where you can sign up
for free daily updates

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:12.560
on the latest in nutrition research
via bite-sized videos and articles.

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:14.400
Everything on the website is free.

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:17.520
There’s no ads, no corporate sponsorship.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:21.040
It’s strictly non-commercial.
I’m not selling anything.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:24.320
I just put it up as a public service,
as a labor of love,

00:15:24.320 --> 00:15:27.280
as a tribute to my grandmother,

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:35.200
whose own life was saved
with evidence-based nutrition.

